00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:55.248
"Person flops out of coffin,
rolls downhill, and hits a bird.

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:58.017 size:88% position:44% line:92%
A bird that's standing."

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.853 size:84% position:42%
It was -- And the line,
of course, was like,

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:03.923
"Yeah, some of them yard-sal
down a hill and hit birds.

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:06.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, yeah,
the hardest thing is, like

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
