00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:15.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Do you distract
a bird with, like,

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:18.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
somebody has to hold a wor
so that the bird --

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:20.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
It doesn't hear
the coffin coming?

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:24.177
-Every time it starts to tur
around you're like, "No, no, no!

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:26.546 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Looky, looky, look."

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:31.651
-Do you remember -- Mike O'Brien
has a wonderful cameo in this.

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:34.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
