a reporter interviewing bugs

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah. Of course. Yeah
-And the same thing.

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:42.028 align:start size:94% position:6%
