00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:48.001 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. That was --
Yeah, Zach and I wrote that.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:50.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I forgot you wrote it
-Yeah, yeah.

00:02:50.737 --> 00:02:51.704 line:92%
